{
  "schema": "live-rule-consumer-registry",
  "purpose": "Machine-readable parity between current rule/data authorities and production consumers. Live rules must name at least one production consumer and focused regression. Reference-only or partial rules must be classified explicitly instead of masquerading as executable mechanics.",
